      "question": "What has Brad built across the stack?",
      "answer": "Across Brad’s roles and side projects, Brad has built work spanning mobile, web, backend, and AI. At Hopper, Brad co-architected and built RemoteUI, a server-driven UI framework rendered natively with Jetpack Compose and MVVM on Android and SwiftUI on iOS, and co-developed Scala services and partner API contracts for order confirmation, payment collection, contract creation and persistence, and servicing, including refunds and rebooking. On VINDecoded, Brad re-platformed the product from AngularJS/Cordova to a React/TypeScript web app, native Android and iOS apps, and a Node.js/TypeScript API backed by SQL, Firebase, Azure and cloud analytics. For Sudoku World, one Angular game runs on the web and inside native Android (WebView) and iOS (WKWebView) apps, on a Firebase backend.",
